  "localChanges": [
    "Button retains data-variant/data-size and native touch sizing.",
    "Label makes htmlFor and children explicit for the application linter.",
    "Popover forwards collisionPadding to Positioner.",
    "Combobox uses a direct package subpath; Rails aliases and Lucide icons resolved; no application font override.",
    "Stock shadcn Zinc tokens replace the authored web palette; controls use upstream color variants. Overlay reduced motion remains explicit.",
    "Calendar, Input, Textarea and InputGroup retain their earlier Core source. Sonner is introduced from the Oscar reference, adapted from its captured radix-vega wrapper.",
    "IslandBoundary wraps each root in CSPProvider using the initial document nonce.",
    "ResponsiveNavigation composes stock default and icon-sm buttons without custom web minimum sizes; native touch adaptations remain shared.",
    "Sonner retains the upstream stylesheet in the CSS bundle, omitting only its unnonced package-entrypoint injection."
  ],
